    "type": "question",
    "label": "6",
    "prompt": "The difference between two numbers is 18. The sum of the two numbers is 20. Find the two numbers.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$19$ and $1$.",
      "worked": "Let the larger number be $x$. The smaller number is $x-18$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}x+(x-18)&=20\\\\2x-18&=20\\\\2x&=38\\\\x&=19\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe smaller number is $19-18=1$.\n\nCheck: $19-1=18$ and $19+1=20$.",
